<title>USA: Peterson Publishing sells $100 mln in junk debt.</title>
<headline>Peterson Publishing sells $100 mln in junk debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Peterson Publishing Inc was priced on Wednesday, according to market sources.</p>
<p>First Union Capital Markets Corp and CIBC Wood Gundy Securities Corp served a co-lead managers.</p>
<p>BORROWER: PETERSON PUBLISHING CO LLC</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	COUPON 11 1/8 PCT  MATURITY DUE 11/15/06</p>
<p>TYPE SR SUB NOTES ISS PRICE PAR	FIRST PAY DATE 5/15/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B3   YIELD 11 1/8 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-MINUS  SPREAD 495 BP	CALLABLE NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212-859-1662</p>
</text>
